        "email": "noreply@github.com",
        "date": "2026-10-21T07:43:23Z"
      },
      "message": "fix(skill): make compose-next source YAML-safe and clarify finish contract (#2696)\n\n* fix(skill): make compose-next source YAML-safe and clarify finish contract\n\nReplace PR #id / MR !id source pointers with branch-name | pr-url | mr-url so the\nspec frontmatter stays valid YAML. Use {{}} fill-ins instead of angle brackets,\nmove S labels onto Design H3s, make covers optional, treat Journey log as its own\noptional section, and require a separate confirmation before any merge.\n\n* docs(skill): drop vague unfinished-markers rule from compose-next\n\nStrong models do not need an ambiguous ban that could be read as forbidding\nedge-case discussion; remove the rule instead of clarifying it.",
      "tree": {
        "sha": "b052682a9f104481e951b6cab4a6b82903da2c54",
        "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/XiaomiMiMo/MiMo-Code/git/trees/b052682a9f104481e951b6cab4a6b82903da2c54"
      },
