        "reason": "valid",
        "signature": "-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJq2G0bCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAVLQQAASJ6RfOwZK5SYuLP48pQC1w\nZRLuhlCmX/hlnuWM86LjVVHL6A/14QWyercbOmNyYyQdSJxVZQ7S+ZvxdnpIz7B2\nvQaGGYnz6sUh+lD/oHd5RzyVZ9Ct4sO8YJOQoQaslspYjZbD/NU7dOTl11FzSz6F\nWANJ7302GRunrNE8wu+Cjf7SVxcD7aM2KLeX5dg8csR7qf2+aMdop8oa8pXCZQ9D\n9rCpsbWaWqNHU3rjv0IW59szNA/d2+L88k6D52GsleachU9XB5H5GYMYehmVDph6\n8BoAWdsHtwc+eEYjnC1lRZ7QHzROGbPH6+I+GHhzIN1xMQP4LogBeyOdNzSUsQnY\nCup+nhHovzGso3RHRnxzqv22ry99KSmHHbfBdr/6TPjtIf5qZ7nm+rQVy1pI29NN\nmNEuWbOGcc87n0vFQDuaNfM5hJYP98N4soZhFdDyL6L4/zJZwWub77pcMFg2fhiQ\nmnMWKKvHg1J2lBuImwLaaJ6abyB19359k0QVLIlKBjVJB9aHIvd/RtYTJxQeFFYl\ngvvfOvtrZImu2Xupbho736C60nzobYj4nycHHXVkq+5KW8isGStJE0sNk80EjhO0\nx3PSAjHNJrYFWlh4ZVzHLfOK3ynQiB99IQybz4dOrItjTIbrcLFGHPpv14TB4wtP\n/SdHzON38HjNjlLVjzOI\n=oo4k\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n",
        "payload": "tree b052682a9f104481e951b6cab4a6b82903da2c54\nparent b3f0b03c8124ea45928edbcff4240e027aca59cf\nauthor Yihan Yan <yanyihan@xiaomi.com> 1792568603 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1792568603 +0800\n\nfix(skill): make compose-next source YAML-safe and clarify finish contract (#2696)\n\n* fix(skill): make compose-next source YAML-safe and clarify finish contract\n\nReplace PR #id / MR !id source pointers with branch-name | pr-url | mr-url so the\nspec frontmatter stays valid YAML. Use {{}} fill-ins instead of angle brackets,\nmove S labels onto Design H3s, make covers optional, treat Journey log as its own\noptional section, and require a separate confirmation before any merge.\n\n* docs(skill): drop vague unfinished-markers rule from compose-next\n\nStrong models do not need an ambiguous ban that could be read as forbidding\nedge-case discussion; remove the rule instead of clarifying it.",
