  {
    "sha": "88673c41732fcd57bf46abe485b547c00ba78221",
    "node_id": "C_kwDOS2bABNoAKDg4NjczYzQxNzMyZmNkNTdiZjQ2YWJlNDg1YjU0N2MwMGJhNzgyMjE",
    "commit": {
      "author": {
        "name": "wqymi",
        "email": "wangqiying@xiaomi.com",
        "date": "2026-10-21T04:18:50Z"
      },
      "committer": {
        "name": "GitHub",
        "email": "noreply@github.com",
        "date": "2026-10-21T04:18:50Z"
      },
      "message": "fix(session): replace per-message recall reminder with one memory paths reminder per context window (#2689)\n\n* fix(session): replace per-message recall reminder with one session memory directory reminder per context window\n\nThe recall reminder duplicated the system prompt's memory section and left a\ncopy on every user message. The system prompt now names the session directory\nas <session_id> so it stays identical across sessions, and the real directory\nis persisted once on the first user message of each context window.\n\n* fix(session): count only this session's reminder and fall back to the newest unanswered user message\n\nRebuild boundaries name the session directory in their checkpoint File line and\nfork copies carry the parent's reminder; neither must suppress the real-path reminder.\n\n* fix(session): treat any later reply as sent and target only own user messages\n\n* docs(spec): finalize session-memory-dir-reminder\n\n* test(session): ignore the session memory directory reminder in the MCP auto re-evaluation test\n\n* docs(spec): update session-memory-dir-reminder range after rebase\n\n* test(server): ignore the session memory directory reminder when comparing a resumed user message\n\n* fix(session): move the project memory path out of the system prompt into the memory paths reminder\n\nThe memory block now names both <project_id> and <session_id> as placeholders, so it is\nbyte-identical across projects and sessions; the first user message of each context\nwindow carries both real paths.\n\n* docs(spec): finalize memory paths reminder",
      "tree": {
        "sha": "99517682001aee7c8f2dca30e88e8d3da56adf39",
        "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/XiaomiMiMo/MiMo-Code/git/trees/99517682001aee7c8f2dca30e88e8d3da56adf39"
      },
      "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/XiaomiMiMo/MiMo-Code/git/commits/88673c41732fcd57bf46abe485b547c00ba78221",
      "comment_count": 0,
      "verification": {
        "verified": true,
        "reason": "valid",
        "signature": "-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJq2D0qCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAWdgQAHoMSNRXIqfwP4fwQMqPJtvB\nQ5NgLbRQN77ZNHRWF8Q5bAMRWNXzGnI+HwbQ0XH2WRXUmXYM9onAth3WL7j7yi0w\nard85HVEjm7S1WsLbyQPT0lsoe/4N/89em8+EP8w1/vVsKTHVYBRc/Ud0hz0dBnV\nXew2Qndsi1gCEK8lUZBOS5ReWvPKwusVSw3+A1AsNt9umRqTqbQZQknuyBsaL2q+\npKcMXZwyNjBwgvfHrgYsNclhAz2qh1Z4xNyTja4CY78Bm2ZcnYGiLpQyJAip09Wf\nF+ZMSO9kalYDxhT6N4QPKsJxSrP2AlbCaWAGdbWz/CYvsMglkVjK8zTHC0xH+Deg\nCIB6DSzlgQG/+oZ9OKj6hitYyXQlNKoRu6Rl4oUwunoAw3tjZSYzAdlJpMLq32YP\nRb6EYAUxYY1qXfPN+qsS8tZEH0kTM/gb57HQF2aWXAdGILIq9mV9/p6OJTzPLwY0\nq/bCrD4uKgktTHjHYxpTiOdA1zr9eVCMCWZN/1q9GqHQSOff5SqG9XpQ+XUxbyb3\n0tXW5pF1egGWikDrmPT9wnK44TtgP5owcypHdVMl/H1X8/Jow3bJdjLLBQ/4XqEM\nNBEYhH8v5Q46g+WyksBwnXc/qcb/9dVt0zBDCZaFYWd17d3HghuEmUhIOkVmSb/8\ntHbWbYW6f1kRatHs3wML\n=B/GT\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n",
        "payload": "tree 99517682001aee7c8f2dca30e88e8d3da56adf39\nparent cf8c09d5315ea04a5af613f392ff17a8832b33c1\nauthor wqymi <wangqiying@xiaomi.com> 1792556330 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1792556330 +0800\n\nfix(session): replace per-message recall reminder with one memory paths reminder per context window (#2689)\n\n* fix(session): replace per-message recall reminder with one session memory directory reminder per context window\n\nThe recall reminder duplicated the system prompt's memory section and left a\ncopy on every user message. The system prompt now names the session directory\nas <session_id> so it stays identical across sessions, and the real directory\nis persisted once on the first user message of each context window.\n\n* fix(session): count only this session's reminder and fall back to the newest unanswered user message\n\nRebuild boundaries name the session directory in their checkpoint File line and\nfork copies carry the parent's reminder; neither must suppress the real-path reminder.\n\n* fix(session): treat any later reply as sent and target only own user messages\n\n* docs(spec): finalize session-memory-dir-reminder\n\n* test(session): ignore the session memory directory reminder in the MCP auto re-evaluation test\n\n* docs(spec): update session-memory-dir-reminder range after rebase\n\n* test(server): ignore the session memory directory reminder when comparing a resumed user message\n\n* fix(session): move the project memory path out of the system prompt into the memory paths reminder\n\nThe memory block now names both <project_id> and <session_id> as placeholders, so it is\nbyte-identical across projects and sessions; the first user message of each context\nwindow carries both real paths.\n\n* docs(spec): finalize memory paths reminder",
        "verified_at": "2026-10-21T04:18:50Z"
      }
    },
