      "message": "feat(skill): generalize compose-next unavailable-input and finish contract (#2693)\n\n- Cover every unavailable-input case instead of one platform sentinel.\n- Replace spec branch/commits with a source pointer (Local/Branch/PR/MR).\n- Lead Finish with irreversible-action confirmation and end on a plain ask.",
